Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}Angels and demons were circling over me,{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:13.56,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:25.64,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:37.19,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:42.99,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.74,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:18.03,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.41,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:43.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will stop Aramaki here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:49.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:01.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:09.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief Niimi, an arrest warrant has been issued\Ncharging you with abetting the homicides
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:14.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,committed during the Sunflower Society investigation\Nand the assassination of Imakurusu Hisahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:16.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:19.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've heard regarding the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:25.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, do you presume that\NI ordered Imakurusu's murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Regarding the assault team's squad\Nleader, Yasuoka Gayle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he is a surprisingly straightforward man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it appears that he recorded\Nhis communications with you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and is now being quite cooperative\Nwith our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:44.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure that we will thoroughly interrogate him regarding the motives\Nbehind Imakurusu's murder and its connection to the Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:45.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:49.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:03.95,Default,,550,0,475,,{\b1\i1}CORPORATE \N GRAFT{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will return to headquarters for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:09.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bomer, be present at Niimi's interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:12.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu, go to the Narcotics Division's\NHuman Resources Department
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and identity the remaining\Nmembers of the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:16.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Start there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:28.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Councilman... Kanzaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:34.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm indebted to you for saving my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:37.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I was only doing my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That aside, why are you here, councilman?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:41.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was "demoted".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have a lot of time on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:49.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appears that you are going to use this\Nopportunity to cut right into the core of the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:52.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but who do you believe is\Nabove Niimi in the organisation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:55.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not a liberty to disclose that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one will hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:01.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Was it Secretary-General Yakushima?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bulls-eye, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:07.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:11.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He has formidable backing when he needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although this is not widely known,\Nhe carries quite a lot of weight with the MSDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:18.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you for your warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:21.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm just talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:28.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, any results from your investigation into\Nthe identity of the man that gave you the file?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:30.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:35.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We believe that he knows the connection between\Nthe invalidated vaccine and the Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is an important witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:41.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What was he trying to do with\Nthe list of vaccine recipients?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keep one eye out for possible\Nanswers to that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:44.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:47.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Regarding the reinforced exoskeleton's origin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there is some information\Nthat is a cause for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will discuss the details\Nwith you at headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's meet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Was that the Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:05:01.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah. The old man got the guy named Niimi, who\Nwas pulling the strings behind the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:05.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe there was a point in getting shot after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:08.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, what is this reinforced exoskeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:12.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A toy that the assault team brought out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:14.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Major fought that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As a result, her cybernetic body overheated and\Nnow she has to switch into a replacement body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:20.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, {\i1}she{\i} is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:24.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What you said was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My eyes were "stolen", too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going now.\NI have a pile of work that I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would like you to keep this safe for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:41.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By any chance,\Ndid you get this from the Laughing Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:56.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm from Public Safety Section 9.\NI contacted you recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:59.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you're going to come in, then at least knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:00.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's bad for my health!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:05.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want the official list of assault team\Nmembers, complete with photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:09.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Narcotics group follows a principle\Nof not maintaining a static appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:12.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The homeless, musicians, and mafia members...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:18.31,Default,,0,0,850,,{\b1\i1}COMPULSORY REPORT INTO THE NARCOTICS SQUAD \N ASSAULT ON THE SUNFLOWER SOCIETY{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:16.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As such, I can't guarantee that\Nthey're still wearing the same faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Must be an easy life as a paper pusher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:43.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're Aramaki-San from Section 9, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry, I'm from Kyoto Sports, and-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I had something I wanted to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:56.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This man is your brother, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:07:01.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just yesterday, this Yousuke person was\Narrested for illegal narcotics trafficking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and is now in a police hospital to receive\Ntreatment for a case of serious drug addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:08.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Have you heard anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It does appear to be my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:17.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I have not seen him since\Nhe went MIA during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:20.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can I ask you a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, hey! The photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:56.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is your new body, Motoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:58.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's the same as your current one, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:00.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should have had it custom made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't care about its appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:06.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this? They're all illegal options!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:10.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wow, just thinking about them makes me excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:14.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Er, was it all right for me to be the witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:16.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure there won't be any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:19.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, you do have an official licence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you fasten the back of this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.87,0:08:24.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, the doctor is pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go take a look, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm Aramaki from Public Safety Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:42.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would like to see my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:45.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but my superiors have ordered that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:50.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you are not to be granted\Nfamily visitation rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I only require three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:54.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm just going to confirm facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:57.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry, but these are the regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:58.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:03.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:06.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is Aramaki Yousuke's condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I cannot answer that question either, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:12.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry to have made you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:32.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will be your physician today. My name is Sano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:37.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh? This can't be your first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:39.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll make sure it won't hurt, so you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:45.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then, let's start the diagnosis right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:48.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please observe from the viewing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:55.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This must be your new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:10:00.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While the transfer is in progress,\NI will deactivate your network functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:06.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This room will also block all radio\Nwaves until the transfer is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Would you please give me permission to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:09.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get it over with, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm in a bit of a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're an impatient one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:22.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now then, allow me to inspect your interior...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As expected, you have quite a nice body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The old man is running late, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:38.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've been anxious ever since the\NLaughing Man stole your eyes, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:42.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was supposed to be here to\Nget an update from the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess I'll try and track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:57.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was back once already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:11:01.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He ran an ID check on a newspaper\Nreporter from the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:03.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:06.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief has his cyberbrain on autistic mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:08.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the GPS?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His car is in the Shoui\NRefugee Residential Sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:13.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The logs say that it was\Nparked there three minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In a place that dangerous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the hell is he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:35.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.87,0:11:46.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yousuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that you, Yousuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Were you able to come back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wow, you're wearing a nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:56.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that from you-know-whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:12:00.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You know Yousuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:04.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're Yousuke's little brother, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I could tell right away\Nbecause you look just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:09.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, Yousuke was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:13.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, although he was taken\Naway by the police yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:17.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:28.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yousuke was respected by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was the one who brought order to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:36.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Until he did, this place was lawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:41.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But the police came out of\Nnowhere and took Yousuke away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:44.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, it had nothing to do with\Nillegal narcotics trafficking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:45.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.93,0:12:53.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I recorded what the police did on this disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:56.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The data should be able to\Nprove Yousuke's innocence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's save Yousuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:11.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No signs of tampering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:13.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does that mean he got off here voluntarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:18.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you pick up footage inside the sector?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:21.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I found a log of the security cameras\Nwithin the residential sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief's meeting with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The resolution is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you get rid of the noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It may take me a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:35.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, I've determined the current appearances\Nof the three remaining members of the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:38.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll send you the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:38.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:40.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Toss it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:46.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just you wait...\NI'll deal with all of you in due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think you're doing? Let me go!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We had a tip-off. Stop resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:52.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:53.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You won't find anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:56.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys framed me, bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:02.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As I'd thought, the charge was false.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:11.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, the dirty bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:15.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They probably wanted a prize and framed Yousuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:23.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yousuke never laid a single finger on any drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.99,0:14:29.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With this much evidence,\NI can prove my brother's innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:35.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you. I will repay you for this one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:42.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all... you won't be able\Nto go back safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:54.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I got rid of the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:01.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,These guys are...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:02.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll send the data now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:07.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, this is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:10.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief was set up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:14.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His cyberbrain's autistic mode was disabled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:23.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait a minute... what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Drugs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:26.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The situation's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:29.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The authorities are rushing to\Nthe Refugee Residential Sector
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:31.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to make an arrest for red-handed\Nillegal drug trafficking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:32.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:00.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does your brain hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:02.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A humorless joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The brain cannot feel pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:08.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's relax and enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:10.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or could it be that you don't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Unfortunately, that is the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:15.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now that you know, can you hurry up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't really have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:20.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My, being a little arrogant, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I limited your speech centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:31.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course, not that anyone will come\Nto save you even if you were to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.20,0:16:43.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hello, Miss Chrysalis. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:48.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My, what rebellious eyes. That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is a world without the colour red?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:59.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To tell you the truth,\NI don't really want to do such barbaric things,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:05.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but you went a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The authorities have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:31.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:37.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, is this really-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:41.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going on, damn it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:48.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it... Hold on, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:55.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this? Is it to spite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:58.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your brainwaves indicate your discomfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, please use my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:08.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're the Laughing Man, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:11.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the third time that we've\Nmet, yet you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:14.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although they just call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:19.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's quite audacious of you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:21.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I came here to be saved by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:26.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you mean the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:27.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I'm so beat up right now that this\Nis the only method I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:36.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought that if God or\Nwhatever-powers-that-be hadn't abandoned me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then he would lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:40.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How selfish of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:44.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Furthermore, you seem polite,\Nbut say things in such a blasphemous manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:46.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I absolutely cannot afford to lose this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:51.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,if this continues, then all fraud\Nin the world will be justified.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:55.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You sound as if you're shouldering\Nthe weight of the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:59.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then, what would the\NNet's hero want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:05.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to tell you the truth\Nbehind the Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:10.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition, I would like for you to quietly observe\Nthe last challenge that I am about to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:18.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I happen to lose and die, then I would\Nlike you to bring the truth to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.45,0:19:19.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:26.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"The mark of the immature man is that\Nhe wants to die nobly for a cause,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:32.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"while the mark of the mature man is\Nthat he wants to live humbly for one."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:36.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Words of the psychoanalyst Wilhelm Stekel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:43.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As I thought, you're the type of\Nperson I dislike, Mr. Intellectual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:45.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As if you're not one of the former
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,considering that I would\Nsave you if you said "help".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:52.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Repulsion for one's kin; it can not be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:56.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please do something about this, although I\Ncan't guarantee that I can keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:58.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You would, being you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:09.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will leave my memories behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:25.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Farewell, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:39.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now then, I regret doing this,\Nbut I'll let you go painlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:41.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The needles...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:02.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:03.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:04.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The old man got hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:19.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief Niimi, it's time for your interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:21.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief Niimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is your new body?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:32.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You look better than I thought you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:36.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:38.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry for doing this to you so\Nsoon after regaining consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:41.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I have some good news and some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's hear the bad news first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:48.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief Niimi attempted cyberbrain suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:53.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Parts of his speech and memory\Ncentres have lost their functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:58.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His testimony is now no longer\Nadmissible in a court of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:02.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And now, the good news...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Regarding your brother, the charges against him were all\Nfabricated by residual members of the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:13.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can't really call that good news, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:17.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although it might be true that\Nyour brother was really there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:22.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have always been eager to\Nuncover the truth behind crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:29.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the resultant reality is that I did not even notice\Nthat my brother was living under these frigid skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:34.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have come this far believing that turning a blind\Neye and a deaf ear to those who are close to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:38.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,in order to fulfil my\Nresponsibilities was justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:43.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, I am not sure anymore if\Nthat was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.53,0:22:47.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And yet you will continue to fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.65,0:23:27.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.95,0:23:30.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:39.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.71,0:23:47.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.93,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:03.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.23,0:24:05.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
